{"id":"intere_s","lemma":"interés","pos":"noun","rank":1209,"glosses":["interest (a fraction of the amount of what was borrowed)","interest (attention that is given to something or someone)","interest (an involvement or stake in an undertaking)"],"ipa":"/inteˈɾes/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"intereses"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-inter%C3%A9s.wav","formAudio":{"intereses":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-GlyphEnjoyer-intereses.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Eso no tiene interés.","en":"That's not interesting.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461062"},{"text":"Nosotros tenemos intereses en común.","en":"We have common interests.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594812"},{"text":"Tengo interés en tomar fotos.","en":"I'm interested in taking pictures.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526837"},{"text":"Los intereses colectivos deben protegerse.","en":"Collective interests must be protected."},{"text":"He perdido interés en el golf.","en":"I've lost interest in golf.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608703"}]}